    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Palindrome DP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/palindrome-partitioning/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 131</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Palindrome Partitioning</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Choose the first piece, recurse on the rest, undo. Only palindromic pieces may be chosen, and a precomputed table pal[i][j] answers that in O(1). The output itself can hold 2<sup>n-1</sup> partitions, so O(n · 2<sup>n</sup>) is optimal.</p>\n"
